 " that has one and preserves the order of the ticks.",
 "\n"
}], "Usage",ExpressionUUID->"4de4f483-3dd1-45e4-8d2e-7e133c1c4bdf"],

Cell[TextData[{
 "Statement: with ",
 StyleBox["M", "TI"],
 "(",
 StyleBox["v", "TI"],
 ") = ",
 StyleBox["E", "TI"],
 "\:207a(",
 StyleBox["v", "TI"],
 ") \:2229 ",
 StyleBox["b", "TI"],
 " the message relation of ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  TemplateBox[{
    Cell[
     TextData["InfraMessageFunction"]], 
    "paclet:WolframInstitute/InfraCausality/ref/InfraMessageFunction", 
    "WolframInstitute/InfraCausality Package Symbol"},
   "PackageLink",
   BaseStyle->"InlineFormula"]], "InlineFormula",ExpressionUUID->
  "11478181-2a5d-4945-a92f-2b1fef65bd12"],
 ", an association ",
 StyleBox["f", "TI"],
 " is a message function from ",
 StyleBox["a", "TI"],
 " to ",
 StyleBox["b", "TI"],
 " when"
}], "Notes",ExpressionUUID->"3ece7271-e037-4b04-baac-5af6025622b4"],

Cell[TextData[{
 "its keys are exactly the ticks ",
 StyleBox["v", "TI"],
 " of ",
 StyleBox["a", "TI"],
 " with ",
 StyleBox["M", "TI"],
 "(",
 StyleBox["v", "TI"],
 ") \[NotEqual] \[EmptySet],"
}], "Notes",ExpressionUUID->"ce775b1f-d38d-4508-bc36-fec29511ee6c"],

Cell[TextData[{
 StyleBox["f", "TI"],
 "(",
 StyleBox["v", "TI"],
 ") \[Element] ",
 StyleBox["M", "TI"],
 "(",
 StyleBox["v", "TI"],
 ") for every key, and"
}], "Notes",ExpressionUUID->"eceef29f-a5a4-4a75-9936-e23b6f8288cf"],

Cell[TextData[{
 "the positions of ",
 StyleBox["f", "TI"],
 "(",
 StyleBox["v", "TI"],
 ") on ",
 StyleBox["b", "TI"],
 " do not decrease as ",
 StyleBox["v", "TI"],
 " runs along ",
 StyleBox["a", "TI"],
 "."
}], "Notes",ExpressionUUID->"052c3cd9-6ee4-4d56-9f64-44449bdad474"],

Cell[TextData[{
 "This is the discrete form of the EPS axiom D1: a message function is \
single-valued on its domain and order-preserving. The order of the keys in ",
 StyleBox["f", "TI"],
 " does not matter. A partial map, a map to a tick off the light cone and a \
multivalued map fail."
}], "Notes",ExpressionUUID->"2dec20f9-9a08-4533-ba22-db17319bc41b"],

Cell[TextData[{
 Cell[BoxData[
  TemplateBox[{
    Cell[
     TextData["InfraMemberQ"]], 
    "paclet:WolframInstitute/InfraGeometry/ref/InfraMemberQ", 
    "WolframInstitute/InfraGeometry Package Symbol"},
   "PackageLink",
   BaseStyle->"InlineFormula"]], "InlineFormula",ExpressionUUID->
  "31295f19-8043-42a8-8096-8afa3bf93ebb"],
 " on the head is this predicate, and the members drawn by ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  TemplateBox[{
    Cell[
     TextData["RandomInfraMessageFunction"]], 
    "paclet:WolframInstitute/InfraCausality/ref/RandomInfraMessageFunction", 
    "WolframInstitute/InfraCausality Package Symbol"},
   "PackageLink",
   BaseStyle->"InlineFormula"]], "InlineFormula",ExpressionUUID->
  "d004e8e9-2da5-45d1-952d-745e4da25ac9"],
 " all pass. When no tick of ",
 StyleBox["a", "TI"],
 " reaches ",
 StyleBox["b", "TI"],
 ", the empty association is the one message function."
}], "Notes",ExpressionUUID->"76dc26c4-7e14-4f16-9e11-d5a43f364fa8"],

Cell["\<\
The three conditions are independent: the order condition can fail with every \
image admissible, when the images of two ticks are chosen crosswise.\
\>", "Notes",ExpressionUUID->"541e89bb-5db1-44c7-b9fb-67b2524f35b0"]
}, Open  ]],

